3. THE FIX — classify, with one property that must not be negotiable
================================================================================
New classification of `before ∖ after` (`moved.txt` / `removed-recorded.txt` /
`regressed.txt`, raw set kept as `disappeared-raw.txt`):

  moved    -- the path is gone and >= 90 % of its unique Chinese lines (>= 2 of
              them) reappear verbatim at another path. Decided from CONTENT.
  recorded -- the path is absent at --after and `scripts/ci/
              l10n-removed-allowlist.tsv` has `<path>\t<reason>` for it.
  regressed -- everything else, INCLUDING any path that still exists at --after
              with no Chinese in it. The allow list is consulted only for
              absent paths, so it has no power over an in-place strip.

